Package: GeoVersa
Title: Design-Based Residual-Correction Forests for Digital Soil Mapping
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Hugo", "Rodrigues", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "rodrigues.machado.hugo@gmail.com")
Description: Tools for large-scale digital soil and ecological mapping evaluated
    under the design-based paradigm of Wadoux et al. (2021)
    <doi:10.1016/j.ecolmodel.2021.109692>. Provides DB-TARF, a random forest
    augmented by a cross-fitted, out-of-fold-selected residual correction
    (residual forests, ordinary kriging, recalibration), with design-based
    conformal prediction intervals.
